  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The string constant NULL_KEY has the value "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"</p>
  <p><b>NULL_KEY is a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/String" target="_blank">string</a>.</b> However it is only really useful as a <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Key" target="_blank">key</a>.</p>
  <p>For <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Conditional" target="_blank">Conditional</a> tests, NULL_KEY evaluates to <b>TRUE</b> like other strings.</p>
  <p>For list search (like <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlListFindList" target="_blank">llListFindList</a>), NULL_KEY won't match null keys whose type is <b>key</b> without typecasting.</p>
</p>
